			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_117"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆきふらし　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
バトルに　でるだけで▽
てんきを　あられに　してしまえるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:18:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゆきふらし</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:48:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ゆきふらし</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_118"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みつあつめ　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
バトルが　おわった　ときに▽
たまに　あまいミツを▽
ひろってくる　ことがあるんだ▼
ポケモンの　レベルが　たかいほど
ひろいやすく　なって　いくから▽
おぼえておくと　いいよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T10:19:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みつあつめ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>みつあつめ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_119"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おみとおし　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
あいてが　どうぐを　もっていると▽
なにを　もっているかを▽
おしえて　くれるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-26T10:35:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おみとおし</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>おみとおし</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_120"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すてみ　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンが
はんどうを　うける　わざで▽
こうげきした　ばあい▽
わざの　いりょくが　あがるんだ▼
はずすと　ダメージをうける　わざでも
こうかが　はつどう　するから▽
おぼえておくと　いいよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T10:20:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すてみ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>すてみ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_121"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マルチタイプ　か…▼
この　とくせいの　アルセウスは
なまえに　プレートと　ついている▽
どうぐを　もって　いると▽
それぞれの　プレートに　たいおうした▽
タイプに　へんか　するんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T10:20:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マルチタイプ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>マルチタイプ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_122"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フラワーギフト　か…▼
この　とくせいの　チェリムは
てんきが　ひざしがつよいの　ばあい▽
すがたが　へんかして▽
こうげきと　とくぼうの　のうりょくが▽
あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T10:21:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フラワーギフト</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>フラワーギフト</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_123"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ナイトメア　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
まいターン　ねむっている▽
あいての　たいりょくを　へらすんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:40:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ナイトメア</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ナイトメア</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_124"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わるいてぐせ　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
ちょくせつこうげき　した　ときに▽
あいての　どうぐを　うばうんだ▼
まぁ…▼
もちものを　もっていない　ことが
じょうけん　なんだけどね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T10:24:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わるいてぐせ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>わるいてぐせ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_125"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちからずく　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
わざの　いりょくが　あがる　かわりに▽
ついかこうかが　でなく　なるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-26T11:40:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちからずく</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:48:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ちからずく</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_126"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あまのじゃく　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
のうりょくへんかが　さかさまで▽
あがったら　さがって▽
さがったら　あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-26T12:32:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あまのじゃく</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>あまのじゃく</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_127"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きんちょうかん　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
バトルちゅうに　あいてが▽
きのみを　つかえなく　してしまうんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
