		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_137"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どくぼうそう　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
どくに　なると▽
こうげきが　あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T03:22:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どくぼうそう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>どくぼうそう</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
