			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TOKUSEI_STR_159"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すなのちから　か…▼
この　とくせいの　ポケモンは
てんきが　すなあらしの　ばあい▽
じめんタイプや　いわタイプ▽
はがねタイプの　わざの▽
いりょくが　あがるんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nishino:W00221"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:47:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すなのちから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>すなのちから</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
